# NextAuth Configuration
# Generate secret dengan PowerShell:
# [Convert]::ToBase64String([System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes(-join ((48..57) + (65..90) + (97..122) | Get-Random -Count 32 | ForEach-Object {[char]$_})))
